ねじれた昼の夜
it's a twisted night during noon.

4
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,700
昨日どうやって帰った
How did I get home yesterday?

5
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,400
体だけが確か
My body is the only thing I'm sure of.

6
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,800
おはよう これから
Good morning, from here on out,

7
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,000
また迷子の続き
I'll continue being lost again,

8
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:49,500
見慣れた知らない景色の中で
amidst an unfamiliar scenery I'd grown so used to.

9
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,000
もう駄目って思ってから
Since the moment I thought all was lost,

10
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,800
割となんだかやれている
I've somehow managed quite well.

11
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,200
死にきらないくらいに大丈夫
I'm fine enough not to die,

12
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:07,500
何かちょっと恥ずかしい
though it's a bit embarrassing.

13
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,500
やるべきことは 忘れていても解る
I know what I must do, even if I forget,

14
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,800
そうしないと とても苦しいから
because otherwise it would be so painful.

15
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,500
顔を上げて 黒い目の人
Raise your head, you with the black eyes.

16
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:22,500
君が見たから 光は生まれた
It was because you saw it that light was born.

17
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:25,500
選んだ色で塗った世界に囲まれて
Surrounded by a world painted in colors of my choosing,

18
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,500
選べない傷の意味はどこだろう
Where is the meaning in the wounds I cannot choose?

19
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,500
ご自分だけがヒーロー 世界の真ん中で
The sole hero of yourself, in the center of the world,

20
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:43,000
終わるまで出っ張り続き ステージの上
standing out on top of the stage until it ends.

21
