42
00:05:29,990 --> 00:05:32,410
選んだ色で塗った
Painted in the color you chose,

43
00:05:32,410 --> 00:05:35,330
世界に囲まれて
surrounded by the world,

44
00:05:35,330 --> 00:05:38,750
選べない傷の意味はどこだろう
I wonder what unchosen scars mean.

45
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:41,050
ご自分だけがヒーロー
You are your own hero,

46
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:43,770
世界の真ん中で
in the center of the world.

47
